      "role": "user",
      "content": "I need a 5-day itinerary for an executive traveling to Singapore, Bangkok, and Ho Chi Minh City for back-to-back meetings. They need business-class accommodations and minimal transit time between flights and meetings. Can you draft a rough schedule?",
